DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Interval");

$set_ans_13 = Compute("{-8, -5, 0, 2, 6, 9} U (((7, infinity)))");
$set_ans_14 = Compute("(-infinity, 11) U ((-infinity, 11) U ((-infinity, 11) U ((-infinity, 11)))) U ((7, infinity) U (7, infinity)) U ((7, infinity))");
$set_ans_11 = Compute("[3, infinity) U ({-10, -6})");
$set_ans_12 = Compute("[3, infinity) U [3, infinity) U [3, infinity) U [3, infinity)");
$set_ans_9 = Compute("{-9, -4, 2, 5, 7, 10} U [6, infinity)");
$set_ans_10 = Compute("{1, 10} U [6, infinity) U {-9, -4, 2, 5, 7, 10}");
$set_ans_6 = Compute("((-infinity, 10) - ((-infinity, 10)))");
$set_ans_7 = Compute("((-infinity, 10) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-9, -3, 10})) U (-infinity, 10) U (-infinity, 10)");
$set_ans_8 = Compute("{-9, -3, 10} U {-9, -3, 10} - ((-infinity, infinity) - ((-infinity, 10))) U {-9, -3, 10}");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("{-8, 1, 5, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (0, 11)) U {-8, 1, 5, 9}");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("{-8, 1, 5, 9} U ((({-8, 1, 5, 9}) U ({-8, 1, 5, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-8, 1, 5, 9})) U (7, infinity) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (0, 11))))");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("{8, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - ((-infinity, 10))) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {8, 9})");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("(-infinity, 10) U {-8, -3, 7, 9, 10}");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("((-infinity, 10) - (-infinity, 10))");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{8, 9\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x < 10\}`]
- [`C = \{-8, -3, 7, 9, 10\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cap (B) \cap A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`B \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}
- [`B - B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-8, 1, 5, 9\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 0 < x < 11\}`]
- [`C = \{x | x > 6\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cap B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`A \cup (((A) \cup (A \cap A) \cup C \cap B)) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x < 10\}`]
- [`B = \{-9, -3, 10\}`]

Compute:
- [`A - (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`(A \cap B) \cup A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}
- [`B \cup B \cap (A) \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \geq 6\}`]
- [`B = \{-9, -4, 2, 5, 7, 10\}`]
- [`C = \{1, 10\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_9}
- [`C \cup A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_10}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-10, -6\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \geq 3\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_11}
- [`B \cup B \cup B \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_12}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x > 6\}`]
- [`B = \{-8, -5, 0, 2, 6, 9\}`]
- [`C = \{x | x < 11\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup ((A)) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_13}
- [`C \cup (C \cup (C \cup (C))) \cup (A \cup A) \cup (A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_14}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
